                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iYyU4kun9Z0PhZ4Ha"><p>Absolutely. Our Extended Christmas Returns Policy applies to all Black Friday and Cyber Week purchases, so you can shop with confidence. Items bought between October 1st and December 25th can be returned for a full refund until January 12th.</p></div></div
